WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.890
Brands and creators need
different support.

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.990
For brands: influencer marketing,

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.670
bringing campaigns together
from brief to delivery.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.440
Creator discovery helps you find
talent that fits your audience.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.310
Campaign management coordinates content,
feedback, approvals and timelines.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.700
For creators: management
for relevant opportunities,

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.621
commercial terms and
campaign coordination.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.758
Explore the service that fits.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.130
Brands, start with a campaign brief.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.230
Creators, explore management.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:32.021
Vyro influence. One team. Two clear paths.
